    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_02",
      "hash64": "49A5A062ABD9D942",
      "text": "Bilde ich mir das nur ein oder bist du seit unserer\\nletzten Begegnung noch schöner geworden?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "5D4C74E974ED2E0A",
      "text": "Danke für das Kompliment.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "5D4C73E974ED2C57",
      "text": "Sie aber auch!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_03a",
      "hash64": "FE4BCEAA032E697C",
      "text": "Hihi! Du wirst ja gar nicht verlegen...\\nWie erfrischend ehrlich! Ändere dich bitte nie![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_03b",
      "hash64": "FE4BD1AA032E6E95",
      "text": "Wo hast du denn die Kunst des Schmeichelns\\ngelernt? Du bist ja ganz schön gereift.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_04",
      "hash64": "49A59A62ABD9CF10",
      "text": "Seh ich das richtig, dass du an Sagarias Stelle\\nhergekommen bist?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_05",
      "hash64": "49A59B62ABD9D0C3",
      "text": "Wenn ich ehrlich bin, komme ich mit ihr ohnehin\\nnicht so gut klar. Sie stiehlt mir mit ihrer\\r\\nbezaubernden Aura immer die Show...[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_06",
      "hash64": "49A59C62ABD9D276",
      "text": "Deshalb bin ich ganz froh, dass du sie heute\\nvertrittst.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_07",
      "hash64": "49A59D62ABD9D429",
      "text": "Dir kann ich ganz unbefangen zeigen, was ich so\\ndraufhabe.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_08",
      "hash64": "49A5A662ABD9E374",
      "text": "Also dann, wollen wir zusammen nach ultimativer\\nSchönheit streben?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_retry",
      "hash64": "29C355AC84C94806",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], bist du bereit, mit mir\\nzusammen\\r\\nnach\\r\\nultimativer\\r\\nSchönheit\\r\\nzu\\r\\nstreben?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
